OVERVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------
This Browser OS is a fully isolated execution platform where EACH TAB
is treated as a complete virtual computing unit.

Each tab contains:
- A dedicated MicroVM (or container fallback)
- A dedicated rendering engine instance
- A dedicated network stack
- A dedicated DNS resolver
- A dedicated transport layer (TCP/UDP/QUIC policy engine)
- A dedicated storage layer
- A dedicated identity profile

NO shared state is allowed between tabs unless explicitly permitted.

